# Dated snapshot copies of the installer. Git's own history replaces the
# manual dated-snapshot ritual, so these pre-git artifacts are not tracked.
# The live working file Void_Linux_Installer.sh (no version segment) is NOT
# ignored and is the tracked source of truth.
snapshots/

# Generated from INSTALL_PROMPTS.md the same way the installer prompts would;
# regenerable via chromium's headless print-to-pdf. Keep only the .md source.
INSTALL_PROMPTS.pdf

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# Debug artifacts from real-hardware installs / LightDM greeter & snapper
# probes. Investigative scratch, not part of the shipped tool. Kept on disk,
# excluded from git.
Debug/
